"{\"summary\": \"The diff adds a nib answer layer to src/zemble/graph/mcp.py: `_line_part` locates a single line via `location_part(root, file_path, line, line)` and `graph_parts` builds text parts plus that one located line per symbol/hit, returning None for non-dict or error payloads. It also adds `Resolution.strength`/`at_least` with `_RESOLUTION_STRENGTH`, new `EdgeTally`/`FileDependency` dataclasses, and bulk provider methods (all_metrics, all_symbols, file_measurements, inbound_tallies, outgoing_edges, source_files, unresolved_name_tallies, file_dependencies) backed by SQL helpers `_under` and `_kinds_clause`. Store changes add `symbol_metrics` and file `lines`/`comment_lines` columns, a migration that clears mtime stamps, and `load_facts_file(..., symbols_only=True)` for the symbol table.\", \"ranges\": [[295, 334], [448, 463], [602, 618], [685, 716], [920, 930]]}"